<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CTC cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CTC cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear, Stearns &amp; Co analysts Rizwan Ali and C.A. Recouso on Friday cut their rating for Compania de Telecomunicaciones de Chile SA, or CTC, to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- The downgrade came &quot;in consideration of the stock's spectacular rise since Jan 1, which culminated yesterday with CTC's (American Depositary Receipts) rising another 4.5 percent and eclipsing our $28/ADR target price,&quot; Ali and Recouso wrote.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares opened down 1/8 to 29.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
